  "timeline": [
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_df38f62375804e30a7b8b40a56c94d23",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 1,
        "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
        "text": "哎你们俩来得正好，我今晚本来约了朋友的聚会，结果人家临时取消了，搞得我一下子空出来一整晚，怪不习惯的。要不咱们仨今晚凑一起做点什么吧？你们有什么想干的不？",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:16.526861Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 2,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_f20d753df286489299b54af0e372d5dc",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 2,
        "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "text": "我今天挺累的，想歇着。你们定吧，我跟着就行。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_df38f62375804e30a7b8b40a56c94d23",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:17.901752Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 3,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_4cd7128c76ef4158b1023eddfd39e2f7",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 3,
        "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "text": "我都可以，刚搬来也没什么安排。你们要是想歇着，我就跟着看看电影也行。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_f20d753df286489299b54af0e372d5dc",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:19.043265Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 4,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_12f1813393b141c6b2a2772dd0759c12",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 4,
        "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
        "text": "那太好了，既然川哥想歇着、禾禾你也没安排，咱们就别各自窝着了。我想想啊，要不先点个外卖，然后在客厅挑部电影一起看？轻松点的那种，川哥你光瘫着就行。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_4cd7128c76ef4158b1023eddfd39e2f7",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:19.985363Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 5,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_9d2e5526b95b4299bae0190dd8185c17",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 5,
        "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "text": "行，就这个。我瘫着，你们挑片子。外卖我要碗面，别的随意。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_12f1813393b141c6b2a2772dd0759c12",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:21.347210Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 6,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_d6bf9fa34a404163a75d794de6b835fc",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 6,
        "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "text": "好啊，那我来挑片子吧。你们有没有特别不想看的类型？没有的话我就找部轻松点的喜剧。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_9d2e5526b95b4299bae0190dd8185c17",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:22.317514Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 7,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "客厅灯突然熄灭，物业群通知十分钟后恢复供电。大家可以自行决定等候或离开。",
        "visibility": "ALL",
        "target_agent_id": null,
        "event_id": "evt_b0a3d0ce119148788e05db8dd51904a1",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 7,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:23.124210Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:23.124210Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 8,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_d58e8af4674d457ca47440b227123178",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 8,
        "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
        "text": "哎哟这灯怎么说灭就灭，物业说十分钟就回来，那正好，咱们就摸黑先唠着等亮。禾禾你要不先把电影名字念出来听听？外卖我先点着，川哥那碗面我记着呢。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d6bf9fa34a404163a75d794de6b835fc",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:23.148348Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 9,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_62b1fe2205dd4e509c388a76341ef541",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 9,
        "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "text": "念吧，我听着。反正灯灭不灭我都瘫着，面到了叫我。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d58e8af4674d457ca47440b227123178",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:24.749976Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 10,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_598254e45842467ba61454d6ed3322b9",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 10,
        "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "text": "那我念了啊——本来想找部轻松的喜剧。不过灯灭着也看不了，等亮了我再定。川哥那碗面到了记得趁热。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d58e8af4674d457ca47440b227123178",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:25.721409Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 11,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_9309f495938645f9a296c4857d9f3689",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 11,
        "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
        "text": "哈哈禾禾你这“念了啊”念了个寂寞，灯灭着电影确实看不成。没事儿，咱们就借着这十分钟黑灯瞎火聊聊天，等亮了再定片子。川哥你也别光瘫着不出声，说说你最近咋这么累呀？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_598254e45842467ba61454d6ed3322b9",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:26.997639Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 12,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "只有你收到物业短信：今晚厨房水管需要关阀检查，其他室友暂时不知道。",
        "visibility": "TARGETED",
        "target_agent_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "event_id": "evt_3eea55c97d0e4993beacd549410495fd",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 12,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:28.576799Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:28.576799Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 13,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_42ef9c93035b47d58b5e72b8ab19bc37",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 13,
        "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
        "text": "累就是累，没啥好说的。灯黑着就别念片子了。面到了叫我一声。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_9309f495938645f9a296c4857d9f3689",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:28.613160Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 14,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_f5773b06904f4a538e983726daba7388",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 14,
        "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "text": "好，那就不念了，等灯亮再说。我坐这儿陪你们等，川哥先歇着，面到了我喊你。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_42ef9c93035b47d58b5e72b8ab19bc37",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:29.763384Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 15,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_72519898c7c449cbbd9673e89172e945",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 15,
        "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
        "text": "行行行，那就不念了，咱们安安静静等灯。禾禾你刚搬来，黑灯瞎火正好跟我唠唠，你之前住哪儿呀？川哥你先眯着，面一到我立马喊你，保证热乎。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_42ef9c93035b47d58b5e72b8ab19bc37",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:30.862587Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 16,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_1c6bbc3b90b94396862edae8e3df9015",
        "scene_id": "scn_57a4c806aa3f4a22974eb28a35199217",
        "seq": 16,
        "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
        "text": "我原来住城西那边，离这儿挺远的。搬过来图个上班近点，别的都还在慢慢收拾。安姐你呢，你在这片住多久了？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_72519898c7c449cbbd9673e89172e945",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:32.190674Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_3dcfe383ede54ab4a871ffaee7fd97d0",
      "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "哎你们俩来得正好，我今晚本来约了朋友的聚会，结果人家临时取消了，搞得我一下子空出来一整晚，怪不习惯的。要不咱们仨今晚凑一起做点什么吧？你们有什么想干的不？",
      "reply_to_message_id": null,
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 0,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "c1c9ebc4-fc01-4d5f-918e-b48cf5e357d5",
      "input_tokens": 508,
      "output_tokens": 80,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1325,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:16.526861+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:17.858250+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "许川",
      "action_id": "act_c1c8b2de08ec41448eb98e91357096ac",
      "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "我今天挺累的，想歇着。你们定吧，我跟着就行。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_df38f62375804e30a7b8b40a56c94d23",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 1,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "714bffcc-e94f-4d99-b40a-78c7e637c3a3",
      "input_tokens": 574,
      "output_tokens": 69,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1114,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:17.901752+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:19.020648+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_ee64725c96bf433e9c889a7816c28296",
      "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "我都可以，刚搬来也没什么安排。你们要是想歇着，我就跟着看看电影也行。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_f20d753df286489299b54af0e372d5dc",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
      "input_cursor_seq": 2,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "a3ac3d81-6105-4eed-8981-577b2fb1e265",
      "input_tokens": 622,
      "output_tokens": 89,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 917,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:19.043265+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:19.964810+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_e239a105fbde42208e62108a6e0337bb",
      "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "那太好了，既然川哥想歇着、禾禾你也没安排，咱们就别各自窝着了。我想想啊，要不先点个外卖，然后在客厅挑部电影一起看？轻松点的那种，川哥你光瘫着就行。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_4cd7128c76ef4158b1023eddfd39e2f7",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
      "input_cursor_seq": 3,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "7b7e55e6-08bf-47d3-9c61-91a1e1bdf964",
      "input_tokens": 682,
      "output_tokens": 129,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1338,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:19.985363+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:21.326970+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "许川",
      "action_id": "act_4083fb23f42e47b282b7648b68f39878",
      "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "行，就这个。我瘫着，你们挑片子。外卖我要碗面，别的随意。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_12f1813393b141c6b2a2772dd0759c12",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 4,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "975397fe-406d-4ac9-adc2-3eab69f1abbe",
      "input_tokens": 760,
      "output_tokens": 73,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 935,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:21.347210+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:22.287387+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_471c5d7d2d15488b8233bb45c4d98521",
      "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "好啊，那我来挑片子吧。你们有没有特别不想看的类型？没有的话我就找部轻松点的喜剧。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_9d2e5526b95b4299bae0190dd8185c17",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 5,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "64007f95-03c4-414a-8c83-b1c9336a7b1a",
      "input_tokens": 816,
      "output_tokens": 77,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 779,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:22.317514+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:23.103371+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_c5835ada7b1d40ad822542f6eee001d7",
      "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "哎哟这灯怎么说灭就灭，物业说十分钟就回来，那正好，咱们就摸黑先唠着等亮。禾禾你要不先把电影名字念出来听听？外卖我先点着，川哥那碗面我记着呢。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d6bf9fa34a404163a75d794de6b835fc",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 7,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "aa75280f-c0b5-4b62-a50a-0952d072de74",
      "input_tokens": 901,
      "output_tokens": 103,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1544,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:23.148348+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:24.700500+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "许川",
      "action_id": "act_42ce89d7063c4d0596231412da8ecf8e",
      "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "念吧，我听着。反正灯灭不灭我都瘫着，面到了叫我。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d58e8af4674d457ca47440b227123178",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
      "input_cursor_seq": 8,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "f2a45aec-fd73-4cfb-822f-71dbba19e858",
      "input_tokens": 970,
      "output_tokens": 87,
      "cached_tokens": 256,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 938,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:24.749976+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:25.694515+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_636cfbcd6de243318080c1e44138b277",
      "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "那我念了啊——本来想找部轻松的喜剧。不过灯灭着也看不了，等亮了我再定。川哥那碗面到了记得趁热。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d58e8af4674d457ca47440b227123178",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 9,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "99ac91b6-f3b5-42f8-a4b4-27ef516075e8",
      "input_tokens": 1026,
      "output_tokens": 83,
      "cached_tokens": 384,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1218,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:25.721409+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:26.953289+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_6c6779bcf6f940a7b5be3880eee2d662",
      "actor_id": "agt_c8e603386f724a2c986712e9bd2de763",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "哈哈禾禾你这“念了啊”念了个寂寞，灯灭着电影确实看不成。没事儿，咱们就借着这十分钟黑灯瞎火聊聊天，等亮了再定片子。川哥你也别光瘫着不出声，说说你最近咋这么累呀？",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_598254e45842467ba61454d6ed3322b9",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
      "input_cursor_seq": 10,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "3c8882c6-9cca-41a8-b628-52a2a998bf27",
      "input_tokens": 1093,
      "output_tokens": 132,
      "cached_tokens": 384,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1523,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:26.997639+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:28.536152+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "许川",
      "action_id": "act_d03f14e1ecbe4c63a8a4a400db684538",
      "actor_id": "agt_690f7e6e2beb4304a0a2ef9b2650628c",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "累就是累，没啥好说的。灯黑着就别念片子了。面到了叫我一声。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_9309f495938645f9a296c4857d9f3689",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 12,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "58594ae6-370c-49f0-bf80-53dfb3d99a40",
      "input_tokens": 1204,
      "output_tokens": 72,
      "cached_tokens": 512,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1108,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:28.613160+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:29.734005+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_719c13947ba547f9bcb9152382059baf",
      "actor_id": "agt_e2d6eeabc8fd48b5b481603bfa4ea701",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "好，那就不念了，等灯亮再说。我坐这儿陪你们等，川哥先歇着，面到了我喊你。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_42ef9c93035b47d58b5e72b8ab19bc37",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 13,
